Date>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/meet-this-years-chonky-champion-of-fat-bear-week-backpack-a-laid-back-20-year-old-male-whos-a-stoic-presence-on-the-river-180989595/</guid></item><item><title>第一个女法老？研究人员称，一张古代象形文字的旧照片凸显了埃及最早的女王之一的地位</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-first-female-pharaoh-an-old-photo-of-ancient-hieroglyphics-highlights-the-status-of-one-of-egypts-earliest-queens-researchers-say-180989594/</link><description>一件失落已久的文物的黑白照片描绘了四个塞拉克，这是埃及统治者的象征，最近的一项研究表明，其中两个是她的</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-first-female-pharaoh-an-old-photo-of-ancient-hieroglyphics-highlights-the-status-of-one-of-egypts-earliest-queens-researchers-say-180989594/</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 的巨型星舰火箭首次尝试抵达地球轨道，但发动机问题迫使其提前返回地球</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/spacexs-giant-starship-rocket-reached-earth-orbit-on-its-first-try-but-engine-problems-forced-it-to-return-to-the-planet-early-180989596/</link><description>两家航空航天公司正在竞相制造美国宇航局在将人类送回月球表面时使用的月球着陆器。但要到达我们的月球伙伴，航天器首先必须进入地球轨道</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:30:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/spacexs-giant-starship-rocket-reached-earth-orbit-on-its-first-try-but-engine-problems-forced-it-to-return-to-the-planet-early-180989596/</guid></item><item><title>一幅神秘的粉笔画在意大利私人收藏中被重新发现，被确认为爱德华·马奈失传已久的作品</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-enigmatic-chalk-drawing-rediscovered-in-a-private-italian-collection-has-been-identified-as-the-long-lost-work-of-edouard-manet-180989593/</link><description>一位年轻女孩的素描，采用了马奈 1860 年代生活研究的红色粉笔特征，被认为与该艺术家的几幅画有关</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:55:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-enigmatic-chalk-drawing-rediscovered-in-a-private-italian-collection-ha